# SA-02m Devices tab (DTV / CE-02m-3)
# REPO-OWNED: scripts/11-devices.sh and every web update (OTA and the offline
# pack — /etc/default/sa02m-* is OTA-deployable and NOT in the runner's
# PRESERVE_PATHS) re-install this file as-is, so an edit made on the board does
# not survive an update. Keep an operator override in a systemd drop-in
# (Environment= under /etc/systemd/system/<unit>.service.d/), never here
# (decision 2026-09-08, audit D16 — matches the installer's existing behaviour).
# STAND_API_HOST=127.0.0.1
# STAND_API_PORT=8765
# STAND_DEVICES_HISTORY_DB=/var/lib/sa02m-stand/devices_history.db
# STAND_DEVICES_WIDGETS_PATH=/var/lib/sa02m-stand/devices_widgets.json
# STAND_DEVICES_LOG_INTERVAL_S=1
# STAND_DEVICES_LOG_INTERVAL_EMMC_S=5
